  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Livelihoods</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will provide vocational skill training to women and youth in the slums of Bangalore and Hyderabad leading to employment/self-employment. It will help men, women and youth to access basic financial services for self-employment. The project will network with placement agencies to place trainees; and with corporates and businesses to provide apprenticeship and/or job opportunities to. It will enable access for men, women and youth to small enterprise training for self-employment.</narrative>
  </description>
